<p>Hexes your target and everything within a radius 2 ball around it. Each time they do damage, they take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11%, 13%, 15%, 17%, 18%</acronym> of the same damage for 20 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>